WEBVTT

00:00:07.200 --> 00:00:09.750
I doubt there's anything we can do.

00:00:09.890 --> 00:00:12.500
Give it at least some thought, Kartatz!

00:00:12.590 --> 00:00:15.590
Mama used a Blocking Barrier, yeah?

00:00:15.870 --> 00:00:18.790
Can you actually get through one of those, Sis?

00:00:20.690 --> 00:00:27.390
Back in the Seven Nations Era, Mom reigned
as one of only 24 transcendent beings.

00:00:27.520 --> 00:00:33.200
She's a high-level mage, recognized as the
Master of Sacred Ruins since the Age of the Gods!

00:00:33.870 --> 00:00:38.200
There's no way an average mage
like me could break it.

00:00:38.510 --> 00:00:45.500
Sis, if you're "average,"
that makes the humans basically nothing.

00:00:46.190 --> 00:00:48.730
That's it. I figured it out!

00:00:48.970 --> 00:00:49.920
Bro?

00:00:49.980 --> 00:00:51.710
How to break the barrier?!

00:00:51.930 --> 00:00:55.230
No, why Mother punched me!

00:00:55.590 --> 00:01:00.630
Our Mother found these inelegant clothes
to be an eyesore!

00:01:03.090 --> 00:01:04.810
That's why she hit me!

00:01:09.690 --> 00:01:12.810
I will wear this garb
and go see Our Mother once again.

00:01:13.220 --> 00:01:17.120
That's what it was. It's so obvious now.

00:01:21.280 --> 00:01:24.130
Oh, would you look at the time. I'll be on my way.

00:01:24.330 --> 00:01:25.700
See ya later!

00:01:29.130 --> 00:01:31.570
Discretion is the better part of valor.

00:01:32.900 --> 00:01:34.810
Guess I gotta do somethin'.

00:01:35.730 --> 00:01:38.510
I'll go check on Mama.

00:01:45.090 --> 00:01:47.520
Not that I think goin' will change anything…

00:01:47.740 --> 00:01:50.300
You sure know how to cook 'em, Mister!

00:01:53.290 --> 00:01:54.910
M-Mama!

00:01:55.000 --> 00:01:57.520
Oh? Kartatz? What's up?

00:01:57.810 --> 00:01:58.830
Want some meat?

00:01:58.940 --> 00:02:00.120
Really? Meat?

00:02:01.110 --> 00:02:03.900
- What were we even worrying for?
- Two more skewers, please!

00:03:35.610 --> 00:03:39.990
[Son, Hubbub, Journey, and Bandits]

00:03:42.730 --> 00:03:44.690
Mm-mm! Delish!

00:03:45.220 --> 00:03:48.430
Sorry I made you all worry.

00:03:48.630 --> 00:03:52.110
You should be!
You locked yourself up in a barrier!

00:03:52.820 --> 00:03:55.400
I had a kinda shocking experience,

00:03:55.530 --> 00:03:56.710
but then I got hungry,

00:03:56.910 --> 00:04:01.210
and once I got some tasty food
in me, I stopped caring!

00:04:01.590 --> 00:04:04.410
Getting all worried and sad won't change anything.

00:04:04.870 --> 00:04:06.610
I was being so dumb.

00:04:06.710 --> 00:04:08.010
Yeah, you were.

00:04:08.220 --> 00:04:12.110
The other two looked like
they thought the world was comin' to an end.

00:04:12.310 --> 00:04:14.300
Go check on 'em in person, wouldya?

00:04:16.440 --> 00:04:17.850
Your brother…

00:04:18.240 --> 00:04:22.130
That golden creature that burst into my room…

00:04:22.670 --> 00:04:24.120
that was Skargo, wasn't it.

00:04:24.590 --> 00:04:26.610
That was normal for him.

00:04:26.800 --> 00:04:28.300
Be ready for more of it.

00:04:29.500 --> 00:04:31.710
Seriously? That's his normal?

00:04:32.400 --> 00:04:39.110
And I can't believe he's totally mastered
Extra Skill: Splendidly Scattered Roses.

00:04:40.230 --> 00:04:44.020
Oh, I know! If I just
completely destroy his personality,

00:04:44.200 --> 00:04:47.500
I can simply install a better one!

00:04:47.620 --> 00:04:50.620
Whoa there, Mama! What are you thinking?!

00:04:50.700 --> 00:04:54.910
Bro may be a total weirdo,
but he's been workin' in the country's interest!

00:04:55.210 --> 00:05:00.500
I'm beggin' ya, even if he's a total weirdo,
don't deny his compassion!

00:05:04.390 --> 00:05:05.350
Kartatz…

00:05:05.430 --> 00:05:06.520
Y-Yeah?

00:05:06.800 --> 00:05:08.100
You're right.

00:05:08.520 --> 00:05:14.510
I fostered him, so I can't judge him
on appearances alone.

00:05:16.530 --> 00:05:18.720
I'm glad you understand.

00:05:19.760 --> 00:05:20.820
I'm sorry.

00:05:21.420 --> 00:05:23.720
I-I told you I'm no whippersnapper!

00:05:24.480 --> 00:05:27.030
Mama, somethin' about you changed.

00:05:27.120 --> 00:05:28.900
Yeah, maybe!

00:05:29.150 --> 00:05:32.110
After all, I've got you three!

00:05:32.930 --> 00:05:35.420
What are you tryin' to say? I don't get it.

00:05:35.620 --> 00:05:37.700
I may not have my player friends,

00:05:38.300 --> 00:05:40.020
but I do have a family.

00:05:40.770 --> 00:05:43.190
And that's more than enough for now.

00:05:44.400 --> 00:05:45.450
Isn't that right?

00:05:45.830 --> 00:05:47.810
Thanks, Kartatz!

00:05:49.380 --> 00:05:52.280
Dangit, I just said I'm no whippersnapper!

00:05:57.110 --> 00:05:58.120
What's that noise?

00:05:59.410 --> 00:06:02.410
Those two are still fightin'?

00:06:03.100 --> 00:06:04.450
A sibling spat?

00:06:04.920 --> 00:06:07.360
I guess those do happen sometimes.

00:06:08.980 --> 00:06:13.100
They once set up a barrier over this room.

00:06:13.460 --> 00:06:16.510
They said it was
so they could have an all-out fight.

00:06:18.480 --> 00:06:20.720
So, how are you gonna defuse this?

00:06:20.860 --> 00:06:22.190
With this, I guess.

00:06:24.230 --> 00:06:25.260
Wait, that's…

00:06:28.480 --> 00:06:30.600
Seriously, you're always like this!

00:06:30.600 --> 00:06:33.310
- Three… Two… One…
- It's all for Our Mother's sake!

00:06:37.630 --> 00:06:39.000
There. All defused.

00:06:41.110 --> 00:06:43.100
O-O, Mother.

00:06:43.320 --> 00:06:44.490
Mom…

00:06:44.800 --> 00:06:47.380
I really made you two worry.

00:06:48.230 --> 00:06:49.180
My apologies.

00:06:49.890 --> 00:06:52.610
Mom, please, raise your head!

00:06:52.700 --> 00:06:55.320
Indeed! Mai-Mai, you're the one at fault here!

00:06:55.700 --> 00:06:59.310
Causing Our Mother concern
is the one thing you mustn't do!

00:07:01.100 --> 00:07:03.270
Shut up for a bit, Bro.

00:07:03.990 --> 00:07:07.010
I was caught up in my selfish thoughts,

00:07:07.210 --> 00:07:08.640
and in my desperation,

00:07:09.190 --> 00:07:12.100
I treated you rather cruelly.

00:07:12.410 --> 00:07:15.100
I'm a failure as a mother.

00:07:15.500 --> 00:07:16.840
I'm very sorry.

00:07:22.790 --> 00:07:25.620
O, Mother, I am sorry.

00:07:25.990 --> 00:07:28.030
I'm sorry, Mom.

00:07:29.070 --> 00:07:32.120
I would like to return to how things used to be.

00:07:32.420 --> 00:07:34.060
Yes, please.

00:07:34.480 --> 00:07:37.200
We only got one Mama, after all.

00:07:38.600 --> 00:07:40.700
Everyone, I'd be glad to.

00:07:41.780 --> 00:07:42.400
Also…

00:07:42.600 --> 00:07:43.300
Also?

00:07:43.920 --> 00:07:45.300
Aside from all that,

00:07:45.800 --> 00:07:48.780
Skargo, Mai-Mai, we need to have a talk.

00:07:50.350 --> 00:07:53.730
Well, I guess I oughta get goin'.

00:07:53.980 --> 00:07:56.310
I got tons of work waitin' for me!

00:07:56.430 --> 00:07:57.990
See you later, Kartatz!

00:07:58.070 --> 00:07:59.230
Yup, later!

00:08:04.390 --> 00:08:08.700
M-M-M-Mom, w-w-what are you…?

00:08:08.880 --> 00:08:12.610
O-O-O, Mother, why do you appear so furious?

00:08:12.990 --> 00:08:16.510
You can't go having magical shootouts
every time you fight.

00:08:16.690 --> 00:08:22.000
As your mother, I need to make sure
you're well aware of that fact.

00:08:22.220 --> 00:08:27.810
Oh, and we can't forget to discuss
the overuse of Skargo's Extra Skill.

00:08:31.000 --> 00:08:33.800
I'm sorry, Mom!

00:08:33.800 --> 00:08:35.910
I beg your forgiveness, O, Mother!

00:08:37.550 --> 00:08:39.340
You brought this upon yourselves!

00:08:40.430 --> 00:08:43.390
Cayna, will you come
to the northern country with us?

00:08:43.970 --> 00:08:45.530
To Helshper?

00:08:45.990 --> 00:08:46.830
Why?

00:08:47.250 --> 00:08:51.510
I would like you to come along as our escort.

00:08:51.920 --> 00:08:54.820
We'll pay you for your service, of course.

00:08:55.210 --> 00:08:59.810
You need an escort? Is Helshper that dangerous?

00:09:00.190 --> 00:09:03.990
It is. It's quite the risky trip.

00:09:05.420 --> 00:09:10.630
Both the main road connecting the capitals
of Felskeilo and Helshper,

00:09:10.930 --> 00:09:14.990
as well as the western
auxiliary trade route have been closed.

00:09:15.310 --> 00:09:19.030
So this time, we'll be taking
this route across the great river,

00:09:19.310 --> 00:09:21.430
then making for their capital.

00:09:21.610 --> 00:09:24.120
Why are they closed? Was there a landslide?

00:09:24.400 --> 00:09:26.410
No. Bandits.

00:09:26.630 --> 00:09:28.110
Bandits, huh?

00:09:28.790 --> 00:09:31.400
There's an old, weathered fortress here,

00:09:32.080 --> 00:09:34.810
but a group of bandits has taken it as their base,

00:09:35.090 --> 00:09:37.820
and are expanding their operations out from there.

00:09:38.010 --> 00:09:39.250
I see…

00:09:39.800 --> 00:09:41.510
Could I ask for your help?

00:09:41.690 --> 00:09:43.450
That definitely seems rough.

00:09:44.900 --> 00:09:50.920
Well, I don't really have any plans.
A trip could be a nice change of pace.

00:09:51.920 --> 00:09:54.030
Alright, I'll do it.

00:09:54.300 --> 00:09:55.800
Thank you so much!

00:10:00.610 --> 00:10:03.920
- Mom, make sure you come back home!
- Ugh, Mai-Mai!

00:10:03.980 --> 00:10:05.840
Too tight! I can't breathe!

00:10:06.080 --> 00:10:09.510
I promise, I'll come back
when I'm done with my guard work!

00:10:09.790 --> 00:10:14.720
Bro was cryin' his eyes out because
an important meeting kept him from comin'.

00:10:15.380 --> 00:10:19.230
Well, he'd probably have made a scene
if he did come,

00:10:19.390 --> 00:10:21.170
so maybe that's for the best.

00:10:21.330 --> 00:10:25.790
Knowin' you, Mama, I doubt
I have to worry, but do take care.

00:10:25.980 --> 00:10:29.060
You, too, Kartatz. Don't hurt yourself on the job.

00:10:29.200 --> 00:10:29.840
You got it.

00:10:30.170 --> 00:10:33.020
U-Um, Sir Agaido and the pr…

00:10:33.110 --> 00:10:38.160
Er, um, Prin also told me
to tell you to take care.

00:10:38.400 --> 00:10:40.230
Thanks, Lonti.

00:10:40.470 --> 00:10:42.940
Y-You're welcome! And take care!

00:10:43.670 --> 00:10:46.120
Oh, right. Mom, take this.

00:10:46.260 --> 00:10:46.990
Is it for me?

00:10:47.110 --> 00:10:48.980
No, it's for someone else.

00:10:49.150 --> 00:10:54.820
Could you deliver it to Caerick in Helshper?
He works at Sakaiya.

00:10:55.010 --> 00:10:56.330
Sakaiya?

00:10:56.990 --> 00:10:58.020
I guess I can.

00:10:59.000 --> 00:11:00.980
So, you have a friend in Helshper?

00:11:04.800 --> 00:11:06.020
Cayna!

00:11:06.590 --> 00:11:08.900
We're heading out, Missy!

00:11:09.200 --> 00:11:10.590
Ah, coming!

00:11:10.890 --> 00:11:12.620
Alright, I'm off!

00:11:21.410 --> 00:11:23.690
Was that letter what I think it was?

00:11:23.920 --> 00:11:24.860
For them?

00:11:25.090 --> 00:11:26.000
It sure was!

00:11:27.130 --> 00:11:30.630
I bet the surprise'll make Mom jump!

00:11:30.700 --> 00:11:32.310
Forget jumping,

00:11:32.510 --> 00:11:34.490
she might just pass out.

00:11:37.600 --> 00:11:41.010
I'm a dwarf. Power-type. I love Mama.

00:11:42.620 --> 00:11:46.960
There, there. Such a good, good, good boy.

00:11:49.530 --> 00:11:51.390
This is the great Ejidd River.

00:11:52.450 --> 00:11:53.990
I see why they call it great!

00:11:54.490 --> 00:11:57.580
So… how are we gonna cross it?

00:11:58.020 --> 00:12:03.290
There was a log bridge here
until about half a year ago…

00:12:03.500 --> 00:12:05.820
But then it got washed away in a flood.

00:12:07.090 --> 00:12:10.810
So, Cayna, this is where you come in.

00:12:11.070 --> 00:12:11.870
Wait, really?

00:12:13.890 --> 00:12:14.770
It's all you.

00:12:16.710 --> 00:12:18.700
You're tossing this on me?

00:12:20.840 --> 00:12:23.820
I can't just pick everything up and jump it…

00:12:24.190 --> 00:12:26.810
Key, could I freeze it?

00:12:27.530 --> 00:12:30.140
Doing so would dam the river,

00:12:30.670 --> 00:12:33.510
so there is a risk
of being washed away by overflow.

00:12:34.480 --> 00:12:35.710
Of course there is…

00:12:36.380 --> 00:12:38.110
So what's left…?

00:12:40.220 --> 00:12:41.890
Water Walking'll work!

00:12:47.400 --> 00:12:49.630
There's nothing to be afraid of.

00:12:49.820 --> 00:12:51.500
We won't sink.

00:12:51.740 --> 00:12:53.500
It's still terrifying.

00:12:54.300 --> 00:12:56.710
Now isn't this something?

00:12:56.810 --> 00:12:58.320
The rumors were true!

00:12:58.710 --> 00:13:00.900
It really is possible to walk on water!

00:13:01.130 --> 00:13:02.580
What a shocker!

00:13:02.880 --> 00:13:04.910
And it works on carriages, too.

00:13:08.550 --> 00:13:10.070
We made it across!

00:13:11.300 --> 00:13:13.000
You're almost there! Keep at it!

00:13:20.590 --> 00:13:21.600
Cut the reins!

00:13:25.010 --> 00:13:27.930
I almost jumped out of my skin! What was that?!

00:13:28.090 --> 00:13:29.900
I think it was a laigayanma larva.

00:13:30.280 --> 00:13:33.540
That was a larva? It was bigger than a horse!

00:13:33.980 --> 00:13:35.700
So scary!

00:13:36.220 --> 00:13:38.410
One horse down, then.

00:13:39.410 --> 00:13:41.500
The other horse is panicked.

00:13:41.910 --> 00:13:44.900
We didn't lose any people or goods,

00:13:45.120 --> 00:13:47.210
so all told it could be worse, but…

00:13:47.440 --> 00:13:49.000
Still, we're in a bind.

00:13:49.210 --> 00:13:53.320
There are no towns nearby to get a new horse from.

00:13:53.880 --> 00:13:54.920
That's true.

00:14:02.480 --> 00:14:03.400
Fine…

00:14:16.760 --> 00:14:18.910
Good boys, Puppers.

00:14:19.590 --> 00:14:21.700
How've you been, centaur?

00:14:21.900 --> 00:14:24.030
Very well, thank you, my master.

00:14:24.490 --> 00:14:25.150
I'm glad!

00:14:29.960 --> 00:14:31.230
They are afraid.

00:14:31.400 --> 00:14:33.110
Yeah, I can tell.

00:14:33.230 --> 00:14:34.220
But why?

00:14:34.630 --> 00:14:36.410
W-What are those?!

00:14:36.630 --> 00:14:38.710
A cerberus and a centaur, why?

00:14:39.020 --> 00:14:40.790
I thought they'd pull a carriage.

00:14:40.820 --> 00:14:43.220
No way! They'll spook the horses!

00:14:43.320 --> 00:14:45.210
Really? You sure they won't work?

00:14:45.310 --> 00:14:47.680
Definitely not! There's just no way!

00:14:47.760 --> 00:14:49.510
Such is the way of things.

00:14:49.860 --> 00:14:53.890
They are but human. Our species are incompatible.

00:14:55.000 --> 00:14:55.780
What's more…

00:14:55.880 --> 00:14:56.620
What else?

00:14:57.100 --> 00:14:58.900
I must apologize, my master,

00:14:59.140 --> 00:15:02.690
but I do not wish to act as a workhorse.

00:15:04.050 --> 00:15:06.020
Aw, really?

00:15:06.210 --> 00:15:07.430
Then…

00:15:21.090 --> 00:15:24.710
Well? You can't complain if it's this cute!

00:15:24.820 --> 00:15:26.200
Uh, yeah?

00:15:26.500 --> 00:15:29.200
At least if it wasn't so… large.

00:15:30.230 --> 00:15:35.190
Sorry, Li'l P, but could I
get you to pull a carriage?

00:15:36.330 --> 00:15:37.510
Thanks!

00:15:40.700 --> 00:15:42.850
W-Well, shall we be on our way?

00:15:43.440 --> 00:15:46.320
We should reach the Helshper border by nightfall.

00:15:46.790 --> 00:15:48.750
We'll spend the night there.

00:15:48.920 --> 00:15:49.590
Yes, sir!

00:15:50.330 --> 00:15:52.310
Alright, let's move!

00:15:54.700 --> 00:15:57.210
What an odd band we've become…

00:15:57.530 --> 00:16:01.440
That's it! You're doing great! Keep it up, Li'l P!

00:16:01.860 --> 00:16:04.850
Um, I've never seen an animal like that.

00:16:05.200 --> 00:16:06.390
What is it?

00:16:08.760 --> 00:16:10.630
It's a baby crimson pig!

00:16:11.540 --> 00:16:15.630
I hear that they can grow to be 25 meters long.

00:16:16.920 --> 00:16:17.520
Huh?

00:16:18.210 --> 00:16:19.910
But it's so cute…

00:16:20.370 --> 00:16:21.740
Aren'tcha, Li'l P?

00:16:27.010 --> 00:16:28.320
Look out.

00:16:29.070 --> 00:16:30.300
Evil abounds.

00:16:33.440 --> 00:16:36.210
Use caution. Something is amiss.

00:16:38.560 --> 00:16:39.420
Stop!

00:16:42.780 --> 00:16:43.840
Arbiter!

00:16:44.080 --> 00:16:45.700
You noticed it, too, Missy?

00:16:46.380 --> 00:16:48.840
There's an awful strange presence about.

00:16:49.790 --> 00:16:50.800
The border gate…

00:16:52.830 --> 00:16:55.210
Hey! Come out here, now!

00:17:02.760 --> 00:17:03.940
Bandits.

00:17:05.480 --> 00:17:07.510
Arbiter, I'll cover the rear!

00:17:07.710 --> 00:17:09.080
Got it, thanks!

00:17:10.300 --> 00:17:12.780
Elineh, please stay in the carriage.

00:17:13.270 --> 00:17:14.380
O-Okay!

00:17:15.890 --> 00:17:19.520
Can you two search for anyone hiding around here?

00:17:20.620 --> 00:17:23.730
Leave the barbarians to me, my master.

00:17:27.520 --> 00:17:30.290
They shall become rust on my spear!

00:17:33.530 --> 00:17:36.010
You'll meet your ends here!

00:17:36.100 --> 00:17:39.600
We'll take care of the woman
and the goods for you.

00:17:41.030 --> 00:17:42.790
You think you can?

00:17:42.910 --> 00:17:43.830
What was that?

00:18:05.050 --> 00:18:10.190
Hear ye, hear ye! Gather round, listen and behold!

00:18:10.300 --> 00:18:16.110
I am none other than Heigl
of the famed centaur tribe!

00:18:16.270 --> 00:18:19.690
Calm down. This isn't a one-man show.

00:18:20.910 --> 00:18:23.600
What are those things doing here…?

00:18:23.890 --> 00:18:25.930
He had a name?

00:18:33.110 --> 00:18:34.520
This isn't like the game…

00:18:35.580 --> 00:18:37.350
It's real.

00:18:39.410 --> 00:18:41.680
So, what will you do?

00:18:42.000 --> 00:18:43.680
Your men are dead.

00:18:44.910 --> 00:18:48.710
Curses… But I still have this!

00:18:48.900 --> 00:18:51.580
Boot Up: Fireball!

00:18:58.850 --> 00:19:00.260
Where was he aiming…?

00:19:01.710 --> 00:19:03.280
- Missy!
- Miss Cayna!

00:19:08.380 --> 00:19:13.240
Well? Do you understand now
what happens to those who oppose me?!

00:19:13.340 --> 00:19:18.350
Be you a fool? Such tepid flames
could not hope to lick my master's boots.

00:19:27.610 --> 00:19:30.500
Come forth, enchantress of rime!

00:19:47.910 --> 00:19:52.630
If you want to hurt me,
you'll need something at least this powerful!

00:19:52.990 --> 00:19:54.930
Magic Skill: Convert:

00:19:55.470 --> 00:19:56.790
Liza la Giga!

00:20:00.250 --> 00:20:05.210
I-Isn't this what defeated
the demon king in the fairytales?!

00:20:10.300 --> 00:20:11.730
Splendid, my master.

00:20:24.800 --> 00:20:28.100
Amazing, Missy! I knew you were incredible,

00:20:28.290 --> 00:20:30.610
but you came outta that unharmed!

00:20:33.320 --> 00:20:35.310
What's wrong? Are you hurt?

00:20:35.590 --> 00:20:39.810
N-No. My hair just got a bit singed, is all…

00:20:40.000 --> 00:20:42.870
Come on, don't scare a guy like that!

00:20:42.980 --> 00:20:45.000
I thought it was something serious!

00:20:45.390 --> 00:20:48.500
Alright, let's deal with these corpses.

00:20:49.640 --> 00:20:53.220
When that's done, we'll make camp
in the clearing past the gate.

00:20:59.390 --> 00:21:02.380
We made it through thanks to you, Cayna.

00:21:02.790 --> 00:21:05.230
Hiring you was definitely the right call.

00:21:05.590 --> 00:21:09.930
So the bandits based out west have come this far…

00:21:10.170 --> 00:21:11.720
So it seems.

00:21:11.960 --> 00:21:16.710
And they were able to buy
such a fine staff. We underestimated them.

00:21:19.190 --> 00:21:23.710
This one's consumable,
but it can fire that attack off seven more times.

00:21:24.200 --> 00:21:26.500
It'd fetch a nice price if you sold it.

00:21:27.770 --> 00:21:31.140
And let it fall into the hands
of whomever it's sold to next?

00:21:31.300 --> 00:21:34.290
I'd rather give it to Arbiter than some stranger!

00:21:35.500 --> 00:21:36.940
You want us to take it?!

00:21:37.090 --> 00:21:41.300
In that case, how about I make you
one that can fire 30 times?

00:21:41.680 --> 00:21:42.700
That'd be handy!

00:21:42.780 --> 00:21:44.430
Don't you even dare!

00:21:44.500 --> 00:21:46.420
Please, don't make any of those!

00:21:47.540 --> 00:21:49.400
R-Really?

00:21:49.540 --> 00:21:53.090
I'm so glad Miss Cayna's on our side.

00:21:53.220 --> 00:21:55.660
That's all it takes for you to relax here?

00:21:57.600 --> 00:22:01.810
Unlike in the game, when people are hurt,
they bleed and suffer.

00:22:02.370 --> 00:22:04.490
And if they die, they don't come back.

00:22:05.240 --> 00:22:08.590
This is my reality now.
